{"ID":"20230925154821-20y5bjq","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230925154821-20y5bjq","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154821-20y5bjq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154827-xgx36kp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154827-v9oner0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154827-v9oner0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:46,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:46\u0026#125;","title":"【桂枝芍药知母汤】（桂枝芍药知母甘草汤）","type":"doc","updated":"20230925154827"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230925154827-xgx36kp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154827-xgx36kp","updated":"20230925154827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：桂枝三两、芍药三两、知母二两、甘草二两"}]},{"ID":"20230925154827-ytf70tr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154827-ytf70tr","updated":"20230925154827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右四味，以水六升，煮取三升，去滓，温服一升，日三服。"}]},{"ID":"20230925154827-v9oner0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154827-v9oner0","updated":"20230925154827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【14.71】诸肢节疼痛，身体羸弱，脚肿如脱，头眩短气，温温欲吐者，桂枝芍药知母甘草汤主之。"}]}]}